---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="サーバー送信なし！安心・無料のブラウザツール集 | GlowPunch" description="データをサーバーに送らないから安心。PDF結合、背景透過、動画編集、文字数カウントなど16種類以上のツールがすべてブラウザ内で完結。インストール不要・完全無料。">
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 relative">
    <!-- Background Glow -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full md:w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-bl from-sky-200/40 via-emerald-200/20 to-transparent blur-3xl -z-10 rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
    
    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-emerald-700 text-sm font-bold mb-2 shadow-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        データは一切サーバーに送信されません
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-800 leading-tight">
        <span class="text-slate-800">安心・無料の</span><br />
        <span class="text-sky-900">ブラウザツール集</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-medium">
        すべての処理がお使いのブラウザ内で完結。<br class="hidden md:block"/>
        あなたのファイルや入力データが外部に送られることは一切ありません。<br class="hidden md:block"/>
        インストール不要で、スマホからでもPCからでもすぐに使えます。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4 pt-4 w-full">
        <a href="#tools" class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          ツール一覧を見る
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/guide" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white border-2 border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-bold rounded-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
          使い方ガイド
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex-1 relative w-full mt-10 md:mt-0 flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[650px]">
        <img src="/images/hero-laptop-video.png" alt="Video Encoding in Browser" class="w-full h-auto object-contain mix-blend-multiply" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 py-8 md:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-emerald-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-emerald-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">ブラウザ内で完結</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">データは端末内で安全に処理</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-blue-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">インストール不要</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">すぐに使えて、いつでも便利</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 shadow-sm rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left gap-4 hover:border-purple-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-purple-100">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">スマホ・PC対応</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-medium">場所を選ばずどこでも使える</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <div class="text-center mb-12 mt-12" id="tools">
    <h2 class="inline-block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 relative z-10">
      すべてのツール
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-3 bg-emerald-400/30 -z-10 rounded-full transform -skew-x-12"></div>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-24">
    <!-- PDF Editor Card -->
    <a href="/tools/pdf-editor" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-red-400/30 bg-red-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-400 to-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="15" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-red-500 transition-colors">PDF結合・並べ替え</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">複数のPDFファイルをブラウザ上で一つのファイルに結合・並べ替え。サーバーへのアップロードがないため機密書類でも安心です。</p>
    </a>


    <!-- Frame Extractor Card -->
    <a href="/tools/frame-extractor" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">動画フレーム抽出</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">動画から特定のシーンを高画質画像として切り出します。サムネイル用や、1秒ごとの連続画像抽出(ZIP)も可能です。</p>
    </a>


    <!-- Video Trimmer Card -->
    <a href="/tools/video-trimmer" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-teal-400/30 bg-teal-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-400 to-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 22V2M2 4h20M20 2v20M22 20H2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">スマート動画トリマー</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">動画の不要な部分を時間でカットしたり、スマホ向け(9:16)などに画面を切り抜く処理をブラウザ内で完結させます。</p>
    </a>


    <!-- Audio Extractor Card -->
    <a href="/tools/audio-extractor" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-rose-400/30 bg-rose-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-400 to-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:-rotate-12 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v10"/><path d="m16 8-4-4-4 4"/><path d="M2 13a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors">動画の音声抽出ツール</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">動画から音声情報を抽出し、MP3 / WAV / AAC形式で高速に保存します。アップロード不要で安全です。</p>
    </a>


    <!-- Video Optimizer Card -->
    <a href="/tools/video-optimizer" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-500 to-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/><rect width="15" height="14" x="1" y="5" rx="2" ry="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">動画スペックチェッカー</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">解像度・FPS・ビットレートをブラウザ上で素早く確認・変換。入稿規定のチェックに。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Audio Loudness Card -->
    <a href="/tools/audio-loudness" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-indigo-400/30 bg-indigo-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v10"/><path d="m16 8-4-4-4 4"/><path d="M2 13a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">動画ラウドネス調整</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Normalize 🔊</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">動画音声のラウドネス値（LKFS）を測定。-24.0 LKFS に音質を維持したまま自動調整・保存。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Glow Mesh Generator Card -->
    <a href="/tools/mesh-gradient" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-400 via-purple-400 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 1 7 7c0 2.38-1.19 4.47-3 5.74V17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H10a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2.26C6.19 13.47 5 11.38 5 9a7 7 0 0 1 7-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">Glow Mesh Generator</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">直感的な操作で、幻想的で美しいメッシュグラデーションを瞬時に作成。CSS、SVG、PNGとして書き出し可能です。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- GlowFrame Card -->
    <a href="/tools/glow-frame" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-indigo-400/30 bg-indigo-50/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:-rotate-12 transition-transform">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">GlowFrame</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">スクリーンショットをおしゃれな背景やウィンドウ枠で装飾。SNS共有に最適な「映える」画像を数秒で作成できます。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Tool Card -->
    <a href="/tools/character-counter" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-sky-200">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><path d="M8 13h2"/><path d="M8 17h2"/><path d="M14 13h2"/><path d="M14 17h2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">文字数カウンター</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">入力したテキストの文字数や行数、単語数を瞬時にカウントします。レポート作成やSNSの投稿に便利です。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Token Counter Card -->
    <a href="/tools/token-counter" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-purple-200">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-purple-500 transition-colors">LLMトークンカウンター</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">ChatGPTなどのLLM向けに、プロンプトのトークン数をブラウザ内で安全に計算します。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Sticker Bomb Card -->
    <a href="/tools/sticker-bomb" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block border-2 border-pink-400/30 bg-pink-50/30 md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-400 to-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform text-white">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">ステッカーボム・コラージュメーカー</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">大量の写真をアップロードすると、被写体をAIが自動で切り抜き、ステッカーやポラロイド風に加工して1枚のリッチなコラージュを生成します。YOPE風のポップな画像が作れます。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Background Remover Card -->
    <a href="/tools/background-remover" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-pink-100 text-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-pink-200">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-pink-500 transition-colors">AI 背景透過</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">画像をアップロードするだけで、AIが被写体を判別し、背景をキレイに切り抜いた透過PNGを作成します。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Slide Palette Card -->
    <a href="/tools/slide-palette" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-sky-200">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><circle cx="10" cy="13" r="2"/><path d="m20 17-1.086-1.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L12.5 19.5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">スライドパレット</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">画像から色を抽出し、GoogleスライドやPowerPointでそのまま使えるカラーパレットを一発で作成します。</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Stripe Generator Card -->
    <a href="/tools/stripe-generator" class="glass-panel p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1 block">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-500 flex items-center justify-center border border-rose-200">
